    "No direct oral bioavailability measurement for the query molecule.",
    "No experimental data on intestinal permeability, efflux transport, or first-pass metabolism for the query.",
    "Amphotericin B low-F evidence may not fully transfer due to its much larger size, poor solubility, and gastric instability.",
    "Some supportive analogues are near the 20% threshold, adding uncertainty."
  ],
